WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.5 · Internal Systems & Operations
People and HR systems overview

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know where every people record lives, who owns it and who can see it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep personal records apart from everyday working files.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Limit access to the people who need it.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Use checklists for people joining and leaving.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Contracts in a locked cabinet; trainee check-in notes seen by Diego only; payroll run by the accountant from the absence record.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your people systems and who can see each record.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
